# Resolved by raw main offset (ida_context): these are not exported in the game's
# dynsym, so a bare name would fail SAIL's load-time lookup and abort module load.
# Constructors: the retail binary only has C2 (game always calls C2); point C1 at it
# too so the mod's `new GameDataFile(...)` (which emits a C1 call) resolves.
